# agent worktrees
.claude/

# Per-run verification summaries are regenerated by `pnpm test` / `pnpm typecheck` /
# `pnpm boundary-check`; release evidence is assembled by `pnpm release:verify` into
# artifacts/release/. Durable evidence (provider checklists, benchmarks, offline
# reports) stays tracked.
artifacts/verification/tests/
artifacts/verification/typecheck.json
artifacts/verification/boundary-check.json

# Release artifacts are produced by the build machine; the verification report and SBOM
# for a tagged release are attached to the GitHub release, not committed.
artifacts/release/
